<code>assert (\old(this.isEmpty()) => \result == null) && (!\old(this.isEmpty()) => \result != null && this.size() == \old(this.size()) - 1);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert !\old(this.isEmpty()) => this.size() == \old(this.size()) - 1;</code>
